WEBVTT

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:11.220
The history of gaming extends 5,000 
years into the past to ancient Egypt.

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.720
Ancient games foretold the 
futures of men and kings.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:19.200
They were magic ceremonies that 
determined a person's fate.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.340
These ceremonies were known 
as the "Shadow Games."

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.990
In the present, a young boy 
solves the Millennium Puzzle.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.210
He becomes the heir to the Shadow Games.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:38.300
This boy possesses two hearts - 
one of light and one of darkness.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:42.210
He is known as "Yu-Gi-Oh."

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:50.340
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:57.250
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:04.000
Game cartridges are stacked 
in the corner of the room

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:10.700
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:15.800
You're on the other side of the table

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:19.170
I'm talking to you, but...

00:01:19.770 --> 00:01:26.100
You don't change your 
facial expression at all

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:32.350
Even though I'm this close to you

00:01:32.850 --> 00:01:39.620
These feelings don't reach 
you, don't reach you

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:46.360
What is truly precious?

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:56.530
Pegasus intends to take 
over Kaiba Corporation.

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:59.620
Come out, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:02:00.530 --> 00:02:01.730
What?

00:02:01.730 --> 00:02:05.390
No way!  That's really my brother's deck?

00:02:07.770 --> 00:02:13.640
Yugi's duel data is currently 
being recorded inside this room.

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:18.250
But you cannot enter without a password.

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.990
That won't happen!  I'm going in!

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.000
Let the battle begin!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Blue-Eyes White Dragon's Counterattack

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:43.740
That was the wrong one.

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:46.170
All right!  He survived!

00:02:46.170 --> 00:02:47.420
Yugi.

00:02:47.420 --> 00:02:49.420
Go, Yugi!

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:52.990
It's my turn.  I play this card.

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:01.790
What?  It didn't appear.

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:04.680
There are still three Magical Hats left.

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:09.500
If you destroy the one that's hiding 
Dark Magician, I'll lose life points.

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:14.280
But I hid a trap card in 
one of the Magical Hats.

00:03:14.280 --> 00:03:15.340
What?

00:03:15.530 --> 00:03:17.840
It's your turn.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.340
Yugi, what are you trying to do?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:22.530
His odds are one in three.

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:29.290
I choose the middle one.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:30.700
Attack!

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.120
Nice choice.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:41.930
The trap card Spellbinding Circle activates!

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:49.880
It's true that Blue-Eyes is invincible.

00:03:49.880 --> 00:03:54.610
But there are ways to 
lower its attack points.

00:03:54.610 --> 00:03:58.170
Now's my chance!  Go, Dark Magician!

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.360
Blue-Eyes White Dragon is destroyed.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:20.530
You did it, Yugi!

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:35.390
Are you serious?

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:39.480
Dark Magician is destroyed.

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:44.960
My deck contains three 
Blue-Eyes White Dragons.

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:47.960
Don't tell me you forgot.

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:52.040
Does that mean Kaiba really is dead?

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:57.600
Since I've resurrected as a 
ghost, you're afraid of me.

00:04:57.600 --> 00:05:01.160
That's why you make careless mistakes.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.100
Yugi, it's your turn.

00:05:05.800 --> 00:05:08.240
Yugi, he's lying!

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:11.790
My brother is definitely alive!

00:05:14.850 --> 00:05:16.000
How's it going?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.160
It freezes at random intervals.

00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:22.340
The central control center 
has issued an alarm.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.010
Virtual purge has been initiated.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:28.800
Our access has been detected.   
What are your orders?

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:31.940
Ignore it and proceed.

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:33.170
Understood.

00:05:33.440 --> 00:05:36.910
Succeeded in accessing Booth #146.

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:39.420
Yugi Muto's duel data verified.

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:41.120
Good.  Show me the visuals.

00:05:42.800 --> 00:05:43.620
What?

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.080
Who's dueling Yugi?

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:49.770
He is registered as Seto Kaiba.

00:05:49.770 --> 00:05:51.590
His true identity is unknown.

00:05:51.590 --> 00:05:53.880
He's using my deck?

00:05:53.880 --> 00:05:58.640
Pegasus has a fake duelist 
dueling under my name.

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:01.020
What's the status of the duel?

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:06.140
The second Blue-Eyes White 
Dragon is on the field.

00:06:06.620 --> 00:06:12.940
Dark Magician and Magical Hats's 
combo attack destroyed the first one.

00:06:12.940 --> 00:06:16.570
He destroyed the first 
Blue-Eyes without Exodia?

00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:18.400
Impressive, Yugi.

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:21.540
But he's backed into a corner.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:25.820
Yes.  He has no cards left that can 
resist the second Blue-Eyes's attack.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:28.130
He will definitely lose.

00:06:28.510 --> 00:06:30.140
What will you do?

00:06:30.340 --> 00:06:31.710
There's still an option.

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:35.640
I will lower the second 
Blue-Eyes's attack points.

00:06:35.640 --> 00:06:40.300
Since it has already manifested on the 
field, we can't manipulate the card.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:45.380
But if I inject a virus into the 
monster, its attack points should drop.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.340
Understood.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:49.890
Please enter the level of the virus.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:53.020
Maximum.  Begin the attack.

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:56.530
Understood.  Injecting the virus.

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:04.470
I don't have any cards in 
my hand that can defeat him.

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:06.140
Is this the end?

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.560
You've finally given up.

00:07:08.560 --> 00:07:12.970
Hurry up and bring out the next monster 
that will fall victim to Blue-Eyes.

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:15.810
As long as Defense Paralysis 
is on the field,

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:18.550
I can't play any monsters 
in defense position.

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:21.960
I play Feral Imp in attack position.

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:30.470
Feral Imp has manifested on the field.

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:35.030
Once Blue-Eyes begins its 
next attack, it's all over.

00:07:35.250 --> 00:07:37.720
Virus injection 50% complete.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:40.330
Blue-Eyes showing no signs of effect.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:43.480
Injection 70% complete.

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.660
Blue-Eyes's attack points remain unchanged.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:48.360
Hurry up!

00:07:49.370 --> 00:07:52.110
It's time for the end.

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:52.970
Yugi!

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:55.960
Can't anything be done, Jonouchi?

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:58.680
Like what?

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.000
Yugi!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:04.020
Blue-Eyes White Dragon, attack!

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:12.910
What?

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.880
Injection over 95% complete.

00:08:15.880 --> 00:08:19.240
Blue-Eyes White Dragon's 
attack points are decreasing.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.400
All right!  It's starting to take effect!

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:23.850
Keep decreasing!

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:29.190
What's going on?

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:30.730
What?

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:32.790
What's wrong, Blue-Eyes?

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:41.050
What's happening?

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.570
What's going on?

00:08:46.570 --> 00:08:50.040
Contact our central control center.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:54.430
Seto Kaiba is alive.

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.280
Virus injection 100% complete.

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:02.740
Blue-Eyes White Dragon's attack points 
are currently at 2300 and falling.

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:06.340
Good.  Prepare to attack the third card.

00:09:06.340 --> 00:09:07.460
Understood.

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:09.540
What's wrong?

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:12.620
The system froze.  The attack 
points have stopped decreasing.

00:09:12.620 --> 00:09:13.600
Cause unknown.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:14.830
What?

00:09:16.510 --> 00:09:24.280
Hello, Kaiba.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.040
Pegasus!

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.820
Hurry up!

00:09:39.250 --> 00:09:42.800
Blue-Eyes's attack points 
have stopped at 2000.

00:09:42.800 --> 00:09:44.470
Pegasus!

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:47.940
Firing Burst Stream.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:48.930
What?

00:09:51.540 --> 00:09:55.510
Fire, Blue-Eyes!  Burst Stream!

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:03.200
Yugi!

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.420
Kaiba?

00:10:25.740 --> 00:10:27.510
Yugi!

00:10:27.710 --> 00:10:29.050
Kaiba?

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:37.480
What?

00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:47.130
Impossible.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.030
It vanished.

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:50.820
What?

00:10:51.310 --> 00:10:53.320
The system is no longer frozen.

00:10:53.320 --> 00:10:56.540
Destruction of Blue-Eyes 
White Dragon confirmed.

00:10:56.910 --> 00:11:00.680
Can it be...  Can you analyze 
the reason for its destruction?

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:03.250
No.  Cannot analyze.

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:06.730
Was it the heart of the cards?

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:15.540
Why did that happen?

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:19.320
Kaiba is still alive.

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:23.200
Be quiet!  I died!

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:26.050
No, Seto Kaiba is alive.

00:11:26.050 --> 00:11:28.050
You did it, brother!

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.250
What's going on?

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.970
It's not obvious?

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:35.480
Only my brother could have deleted Blue-Eyes.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:37.310
My brother did that!

00:11:37.560 --> 00:11:40.490
I knew my brother was alive!

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.880
I was able to confirm that Kaiba is alive.

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:50.720
Now I can concentrate on this duel.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:54.440
Why don't you just reveal your true identity?

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.860
Your tricks will no longer work!

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:01.930
Dammit!  I told you I died!

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:16.280
I'm more comfortable in this form.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:21.640
I am the Impersonator of Death, 
sent here by Industrial Illusions.

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:23.840
Yugi, let's play.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:26.590
Let's have fun.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:30.600
I knew you were a fake!

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.680
He's disgusting.

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:37.850
Yugi, there's only one course 
of action!  Pummel him!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.770
This is Team A.

00:12:45.770 --> 00:12:46.930
And?

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:48.820
I see.

00:12:49.600 --> 00:12:52.760
Blue-Eyes was destroyed?

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.680
Miracles do happen.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:57.720
Impressive, Yugi boy.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:13:00.910
They say luck is a part of skill.

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:05.340
Forgive me.  Seto Kaiba is alive.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.760
He hacked into Millennium from 
a terminal in Kaiba Manor.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:13.910
When our agents arrived, he was already gone.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:17.160
No problem.  Leave him alone.

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:21.540
Let's see how this duel turns out.

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:26.340
A nobody can't master my brother's cards.

00:13:26.340 --> 00:13:28.450
Serves you right!

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:34.800
Yugi managed to survive, but we 
still have one of Kaiba's Blue-Eyes.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:37.680
You have no monsters on the field.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:39.310
Hurry up and play something!

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:42.530
The final Blue-Eyes is in my deck.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.470
He won't pull off another miracle.

00:13:45.470 --> 00:13:50.210
If I draw another Blue-Eyes, 
I'm guaranteed to win.

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:52.760
I play Grappler in defense position.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.390
He's planning to survive 
using defense monsters

00:14:02.390 --> 00:14:04.380
until he can draw the final Blue-Eyes.

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.060
It's my turn.

00:14:06.450 --> 00:14:09.250
As long as Defense Paralysis is on the field,

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:12.560
I must play my monsters in attack position.

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:16.440
If he draws Blue-Eyes, I lose.

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:22.420
I set one card on the field and play 
Celtic Guardian in attack position.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:34.530
Grappler is destroyed.

00:14:35.650 --> 00:14:38.800
Aww, you destroyed it.

00:14:38.800 --> 00:14:44.260
I play Mystic Horseman in defense 
position and set one card on the field.

00:14:46.510 --> 00:14:47.920
He set another card.

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:51.170
Is it a spell card or a trap card?

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:57.280
I set another card and play 
Mystical Elf in attack position.

00:14:57.280 --> 00:14:59.920
Plus, I combo her with Book of Secret Arts

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:02.350
to raise her attack and 
defense points by 300.

00:15:09.540 --> 00:15:11.200
I end my turn.

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:15.010
I don't know what she's 
chanting, but it's pointless.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:17.960
Give up already.

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:23.670
He has two set cards and three monsters.

00:15:23.870 --> 00:15:29.670
He strengthened Mystical Elf so that she 
would survive Mystic Horseman's attack.

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:34.010
But if I draw Blue-Eyes and 
destroy any one of his monsters,

00:15:34.010 --> 00:15:37.830
his life points will drop to 0.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:45.250
Their set cards are the key to 
determining the winner and the loser.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:47.710
Don't worry.  Yugi will win.

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.420
Win, Yugi!

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:54.230
Here I go.

00:15:54.530 --> 00:15:56.650
I did it!

00:15:56.870 --> 00:16:00.070
Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:07.150
Yugi!

00:16:07.150 --> 00:16:11.480
It's okay.  My brother will help him again.

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:12.720
You fool.

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:14.970
That won't happen again.

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:17.060
Look at Blue-Eyes.

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:24.060
If Kaiba did that trick last time, 
wouldn't he do the same thing this time?

00:16:24.060 --> 00:16:27.630
But the third Blue-Eyes 
is completely unaffected.

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:28.970
Damn.

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.110
That means...

00:16:30.110 --> 00:16:34.810
Kaiba can no longer help you.

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.590
Dammit!

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:44.300
This feels great!

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:49.050
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:57.960
I activate the trap card Mirror Force!

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:03.820
Not a trap card!

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:07.470
Mirror Force reflects back your Burst Stream!

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:15.810
Just kidding!  I activate the 
spell card Negate Attack.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.050
He knew I'd play a trap card.

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:24.600
Too bad.  I know everything 
you're planning to do.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.930
What will you try next?

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:28.230
Yugi!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:30.360
It's all over.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.530
I still have a trump card!

00:17:34.200 --> 00:17:35.800
Monster Reborn!

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:42.110
No way!  Are you planning 
to revive my Blue-Eyes?

00:17:42.110 --> 00:17:47.560
No, I'm reviving Kaiba's card.

00:17:59.420 --> 00:18:02.440
You've lost your cool 
because you're cornered.

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:05.030
You're aiming for mutual destruction.

00:18:05.540 --> 00:18:07.450
That's not possible.

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:10.100
My Mystical Elf

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:13.400
has been chanting a magical spell 
ever since I placed it on the field.

00:18:14.220 --> 00:18:20.360
That spell allows her to give her 
attack points to another monster.

00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:23.200
What?

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:26.170
Blue-Eyes's attack strength is invincible.

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:30.610
But that doesn't mean it always 
has 3000 attack points.

00:18:30.610 --> 00:18:34.110
Depending on the circumstances, 
it can change.

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:36.730
That's what Kaiba showed me.

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:38.230
Time out!

00:18:38.230 --> 00:18:40.160
This can't be happening!

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:44.820
Prepare to feel Kaiba's anger!  Here I go!

00:18:45.500 --> 00:18:48.510
Holy Burst Stream!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:09.460
I will never forgive you for disgracing 
Kaiba's deck and playing with our hearts!

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.300
Mind Crush!

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:19.530
Pegasus, I know you can hear my anger!

00:19:24.880 --> 00:19:29.770
You used a filthy fake 
to disgrace Seto Kaiba!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.200
I will never forgive you!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:34.010
You'd better be ready!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:45.470
You have incredible shadow powers, Yugi boy.

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:53.160
I'm even more excited than before 
to defeat you with my own hands.

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:05.010
Kaiba.

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:06.750
You did it, Yugi!

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:10.440
I was worried for a moment.

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.370
Huh?

00:20:12.510 --> 00:20:13.790
What's wrong?

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:15.790
Mokuba's gone!

00:20:17.310 --> 00:20:18.760
Mokuba?

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:35.630
Mai Kujaku wants revenge 
for losing to Jonouchi,

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:39.100
so she forces Dinosaur 
Ryuzaki to challenge him.

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:42.160
He'll win again thanks to Yugi's advice.

00:20:42.160 --> 00:20:44.620
What?  He's not allowed to give advice?

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:46.890
Then there's no way he can win!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:50.940
Honda left in anger, and Yugi went after him.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:53.270
Do something, Jonouchi!

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:57.640
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Power of Friendship!
Lava Battleguard and Swamp Battleguard

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.530
Duel, standby!

00:21:02.060 --> 00:21:10.460
The flask glistens

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:18.310
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:27.280
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:35.050
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:40.890
Shower of happiness

00:21:41.180 --> 00:21:45.000
I will shower you with it

00:21:45.330 --> 00:21:53.280
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:57.510
Shower of happiness

00:21:57.780 --> 00:22:01.640
You are not alone

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:08.360
You're protected by a 
giant ring of friendship
